1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,848
The narrator is overjoyed and tongue tied; all the old talk of shells and birds sticks in his throat.

2
00:00:06,848 --> 00:00:09,492
Runtu's lips move without a sound.

3
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:12,682
Then, respectfully, he says: Master.

4
00:00:12,682 --> 00:00:19,296
And the narrator shudders, because he knows at once what a lamentably thick wall has grown up between them.

